{"overview":"بهترین هتل‌ها باید استانداردهای خاصی را داشته باشند: بهترین غذاها، روش‌های آرامش‌بخش و سرگرمی. البته آن‌ها همچنین به بهترین مجموعهٔ سلاح‌ها، روش‌های قابل اعتماد برای جعل هویت و روش‌های از بین بردن شواهد نیاز دارند. در این هتل در مرز مرگ، دو کانسیرژ به نام‌های ایکورو هوشی و سارا هایزاکی ایستاده‌اند. درخواست‌های بعدی قاتلان برای آن‌ها چه خواهد بود؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"The best hotels must meet certain standards, including the finest cuisine, ways to relax, and entertainment. Of course, they also need the best selection of weapons, reliable ways to falsify one's identity, and ways to dispose of evidence. In this hotel at the border of death stand two concierges, Ikuro Hoshi and Sara Haizaki. What kinds of requests will the assassins have for them next?","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2025,"poster":"/6ZHkFKJekNYADTByu3QI7vJaUbC.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/edCc7fsPUERfsYr31dlNsSMUbxA.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小林裕介","role":"Ikuro Hoshi (voice)","photo":"/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","en":"Yusuke Kobayashi"},{"name":"白浜灯奈乃","role":"Sara Haizaki (voice)","photo":"/8zvMRx60I2KVrRRTteeLa4VF2Z1.jpg","en":"Hinano Shirahama"}],"trailer":"zfthL1m2GFg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/276288/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/276288/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/276288/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP